        <tr><td>Careers</td><td>careers@meridian-castings.net</td><td>+44 114 285 6640</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p>Staff and registered partners should use <a href="/help">the help centre</a> for internal support requests rather than the form above.</p>
